  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nGiven equation: 20 + 8 - 5 = ?\n\nNow, if ‘+’ = ‘-’ and ‘-’ = ‘+’, then:\n\n⇒ 20 - 8 + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ 12 + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ 17\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
